999
01:27:52,567 --> 01:27:54,611
Alôooo...

1000
01:28:01,785 --> 01:28:03,787
Alôooo...

1001
01:28:16,216 --> 01:28:17,217
Peguei-as!

1002
01:28:22,222 --> 01:28:24,224
