1043
01:33:19,686 --> 01:33:20,228
Socorro!

1044
01:33:20,937 --> 01:33:21,938
Socorro!

1045
01:33:26,193 --> 01:33:27,194
Chris!

1046
01:33:28,195 --> 01:33:29,196
Achei o ninho!

1047
01:33:30,197 --> 01:33:32,157
E tem uma rainha!

1048
